factory ui — hotkeys  (any key closes)

Global        1-6 or tab switch view · ? help · R refresh · K kill switch
              (stop/start company) · q quit
Lists         j/k ↑/↓ move · g/G top/bottom · pgup/pgdn · enter open · esc back
Dashboard     enter live run (or tasks) of agent · t its tasks · f its flow
Tasks         / filter: p:PROJECT s:STATUS a:AGENT ! open conv words · !
              attention · enter detail
Task actions  p pause · u resume · r retry · n run · x cancel · a reassign · P
              priority · c comment · d directive (!text urgent) · L live run · f
              flow
Run           f follow · j/k scroll · G newest · t task · esc back
Flow          g graph/timeline · p project · a agent · t task · x clear · j/k G
              scroll
Feed          ! attention · p project · / filter · x clear · j/k G scroll
Inbox         ←/→ option · enter answer · a free text · y approve · n reject · t
              task
Confirm       y/enter sends, n/esc cancels; red marks what waits on you




